{
  "name": "Onshore well pad",
  "description": "Single-well onshore production pad. Well XT-101 flows through flowline shutdown valve SDV-101 and production choke HCV-101 into the 2-phase production separator V-200, protected by PSV-201. Separator gas leaves on back-pressure control PCV-201 and joins the PSV discharge in the flare header to the elevated flare FS-500, about 30 m away, while oil is pumped by P-300 on level control LV-201 into atmospheric storage tank TK-401 inside bund BW-400 (bund drain to the oily-water system) and leaves to truck loading at the battery limit.",
  "source": "Deck Twin example (illustrative layout, not a real asset)",
